# Finneas, Ace Archer: "Whenever Finneas attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control that's a token or a
# Rabbit." Bot1 controls Finneas, Third Path Iconoclast (a Human Monk, neither a token nor a Rabbit), Hare Apparent (a Rabbit
# that is not a token) and a Soldier token from Iconoclast (a token that is not a Rabbit); Bot2 controls its own Iconoclast,
# Soldier token and Hare Apparent. On attacking, Hare Apparent and the Soldier token get a counter; Finneas itself ("other"),
# the Iconoclast and all of Bot2's creatures do not. Total power is 2 + 2 + 3 + 2 = 9, so no card is drawn (the same attack
# with ten power draws, see finneas-ace-archer-draws-when-creatures-you-control-have-total-power-ten).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
